---
title: Bird's Nest Cookies
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Cookies
cook time: 18 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@butter{0.5%cup}
@brown sugar{0.25%cup}
@egg yolk{1%beaten}
@flour{1%cup}
@chopped nuts
@egg white{1%slightly beaten}

Mix butter, brown sugar, and egg yolk and add 1 cup flour. Form into small balls and dip in slightly beaten egg white. Roll in chopped nuts and press in center. Bake at 350 degrees for 8 minutes. Remove and press centers again. Bake for 10 minutes more. Remove and press centers again.
